36
00:00:51,588 --> 00:00:53,086
She has to retake her PSLE.

37
00:00:53,086 --> 00:00:54,881
She worked really, really hard.

38
00:00:54,881 --> 00:00:55,735
She actually passed

39
00:00:55,735 --> 00:00:57,025
