43
00:01:00,565 --> 00:01:02,005
and believe that they are capable

44
00:01:02,005 --> 00:01:03,964
of achieving more than they think.

45
00:01:04,019 --> 00:01:05,539
The head coaches and coaches

46
00:01:05,539 --> 00:01:06,333
